beads (bd) is a git-backed issue tracker for agent workflows.

Runtime dependencies used by the bd binary:
  git
  dolt
  zstd
  icu4c77

Build dependencies for this package:
  go >= 1.25.6
  make
  gcc
  git
  zstd development files
  icu4c77 development files

Optional runtime dependencies:
  sqlite (for migration from old sqlite .beads databases)
  gh (for GitHub gate commands)

Build notes:
  Upstream builds through a Makefile and forces CGO_ENABLED=1.
  Release tarballs have no .git metadata, so SLKBUILD patches
  Makefile ldflags to use pkgver for main.Build.
  Go caches are redirected to the source tree to avoid writes to
  user home directories during package builds.
  A network connection is required during build to download Go modules.
